[00:44.73]All these kinds of places
{"这些形形色色的地方"}
[00:46.86]Make it seem like it's been ages
{"恍若隔世般漫长"}
[00:49.26]Tomorrow's sun with buildings scraping skies
{"明日朝阳与摩天楼相望"}
[00:54.47]I love this country dearly
{"我深爱这片土壤"}
[00:56.18]I can feel the ladder clearly
{"阶梯触手可攀上"}
[00:58.61]But I never thought I'd be alone to try
{"却未料独行路如此荒凉"}
[01:03.81]Once I was outside Penn Station
{"曾徘徊宾州车站旁"}
[01:06.29]Selling red and white carnations
{"售卖红白康乃馨香"}
[01:08.62]We were still alone, my wife and I
{"与妻子相依为命的时光"}
[01:13.38]Before we marry, save my money
{"婚前拼命积蓄存款"}
[01:15.65]Brought my dear wife over
{"接来挚爱作伴"}
[01:17.84]Now I want to bring my family state side
{"如今想举家迁至这彼岸"}
[01:22.86]But off the boat they stayed awhile
{"可他们下船后停留短暂"}
[01:25.09]Then scattered 'cross the coast
{"便散落海岸线两端"}
[01:27.48]Once a year I'll see them for a week or so at most
{"每年相聚最长不过一周时光"}
[01:31.62]I took a walk
{"我漫步徜徉"}
[01:33.19]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"漫步　漫步　漫步"}
[01:37.52]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
[01:39.29]Take a walk, take a walk
{"漫步　漫步"}
[01:41.25]I take a walk
{"我独自漫步"}
[01:43.63]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"漫步　漫步　漫步"}
[01:46.31]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
[01:48.17]Take a walk, take a walk
{"漫步　漫步"}
[01:51.71]Practice isn't perfect
{"勤练未必臻完美"}
[01:53.47]But the market cuts its loss
{"市场自会断盈亏"}
[01:55.66]I remind myself that times could be much worse
{"我提醒自己情况本可能更糟"}
[02:00.65]My wife won't ask me questions
{"妻子不会追问我任何问题"}
[02:02.88]There's not so much to ask
{"其实也没什么可问"}
[02:05.31]And she'll never flaunt around an empty purse
{"她也从不会炫耀空钱包"}
[02:10.25]Once my mother-in-law came just to stay a couple nights
{"有次岳母说来小住几晚"}
[02:14.55]Then decided she will stay the rest of her life
{"结果决定就此度过余生"}
[02:19.61]I watch my little children play some board game in the kitchen
{"看着孩子们在厨房玩桌游"}
[02:24.13]And sit and pray they never feel my strife
{"我坐着祈祷他们永远不懂我的挣扎"}
[02:29.11]But then my partner called to say the pension funds were gone
{"但合伙人突然来电说养老金没了"}
[02:33.86]He made some bad investments
{"他做了些糟糕投资"}
[02:36.05]Now the accounts are overdrawn
{"现在账户都已透支"}
[02:38.28]I took a walk
{"我出去散步"}
[02:39.63]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"散步吧 散步吧 散步吧"}
[02:43.15]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
{"散步吧（哦哦哦）"}
[02:45.54]Take a walk, take a walk.
{"散步吧 散步吧"}
[02:48.13]I took a walk
{"我出去散步"}
[02:50.20]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"散步吧 散步吧 散步吧"}
[02:54.00]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
{"散步吧（哦哦哦）"}
[02:54.86]Take a walk, take a walk
{"散步吧 散步吧"}
[02:57.99]Honey it's your son
{"亲爱的 是你儿子"}
[02:59.40]I think I borrowed just to much
{"我想我借贷过度了"}
[03:02.29]We had taxes
{"要缴税"}
[03:03.31]We had bills
{"要付账单"}
[03:04.27]We had a lifestyle of fun
{"我们过着享乐生活"}
[03:07.14]But tonight i swear I'll come home
{"但今晚我发誓会回家"}
[03:09.12]And we'll make love like we're young
{"我们会像年轻时那样缠绵"}
[03:11.85]And tomorrow you'll cook dinner
{"而明天你将准备晚餐"}
[03:13.98]For the neighbors and their kids
{"为邻居和他们的小孩"}
[03:16.47]We can rip apart the socialists
{"我们可以痛斥那些社会主义者"}
[03:18.81]and all their damn taxes
{"和他们该死的税收"}
[03:21.44]You'll see I am no criminal I'm down on both bad knees
{"你会明白我并非罪犯　我已双膝跪地"}
[03:26.08]I'm just too much a coward to admit when I'm in need
{"我只是懦弱到不敢承认自己需要帮助"}
[03:30.43]I took a walk
{"我散了个步"}
[03:32.13]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"散个步　散个步　散个步"}
[03:35.37]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
[03:37.74]Take a walk, take a walk.
{"散个步　散个步"}
