{"我散了个步"}
[03:42.44]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"散个步　散个步　散个步"}
[03:45.67]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
[03:47.29]Take a walk, take a walk.
{"散个步　散个步"}
[03:50.72]I took a walk
{"我散了个步"}
[03:51.93]Take a walk, take a walk, take a walk
{"散个步　散个步　散个步"}
[03:55.17]Take a walk (oh-oh-oh)
[03:56.68]Take a walk, take a walk.
{"散个步　散个步"}
[04:00.23]I took a walk
